<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="page-head with-photo">
    <div>
      <h1>Maintenance and repairs for hotels and short-stay</h1>
      <p>A room that's out of order is a room you can't sell. Post the job, say when the work can happen, and get prices from tradies who are used to working around guests.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:24px"><a class="btn accent big" href="/jobs/new?sector=hotels">Post a hotel job</a></p>
    </div>
    <%- include('../partials/photo', { photo: 'bathroomFinished', eager: true }) %>
  </div>

  <div class="split page" style="padding-top:8px">
    <div class="doc">
      <h2>What hotels post</h2>
      <ul class="tick-list">
        <li>Air con that isn't cooling, or is too noisy</li>
        <li>Leaking showers, failed silicone and cracked bathroom tiles</li>
        <li>Patching and painting rooms between bookings</li>
        <li>Door locks and room security</li>
        <li>Appliances in serviced apartments</li>
        <li>Pool fencing, gates and outdoor areas</li>
        <li>Room and lobby refurbishments</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="doc">
      <h2>Working around guests</h2>
      <p>Every hotel job has an access and timing section. Use it to tell tradies when they can be on site, which rooms you can block out, and where they can't go. They'll factor it into the price instead of surprising you on the day.</p>
      <h2>Paying</h2>
      <p>Pay by card when you accept a quote, and the money is held until the job's signed off. Add your hotel's name when you sign up so tradies know who they're dealing with once you've accepted.</p>
      <h2>Outside Perth</h2>
      <p>Tradies can cover regional WA too, including the South West, Broome and the Goldfields.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/sector-jobs') %>
